pack.name=Cinematic Realism — PBR + Vibrant Visuals
pack.description=Realistic overhaul for Vibrant Visuals: 334 PBR materials (normal maps + MER), cinematic lighting, ACES tone mapping, atmospheric sky, real water waves & caustics, biome fog, soft shadows, realistic clouds/sun/moon, rain & thunder sounds and particle rework. Made for mid-range phones.
